# Private steering documents — on-disk working files, never in history
# Globbed by family, not pinned per version: a rename must not silently
# expose a draft the way reach-designnote-v3 and reach-nlnet-v3 were.
PLAN.md
JULYCUT.md
EDIT.md
reach-designnote-v*.md
reach-nlnet-v*.md

# Key material and secrets — real keys live under
# ~/Library/Application Support/Reach and never in the tree
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.der
*.mobileprovision
Secrets/

# Spike working material (spike code itself lives on spike/* branches)
spikes/*/certs/

# Build products and user state
.build/
DerivedData/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint

# OS noise
.DS_Store
